  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 4433,
      "text": "and do not be arrogant towards Allah. I have certainly come to you with clear proof.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 19,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4434,
      "text": "And I certainly seek refuge with my Lord and your Lord, lest you stone me to death[6].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 20,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4435,
      "text": "If you do not believe me, then leave me alone.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4436,
      "text": "Then he called upon his Lord, “These are wicked people”.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4437,
      "text": "[Allah said], “Leave along with My slaves by night; you will surely be pursued.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4438,
      "text": "And leave the sea parted[7]; for they are surely an army destined to drown.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4439,
      "text": "[Imagine] how many gardens and springs they left behind,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 25,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4440,
      "text": "and crops and splendid mansions,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 26,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4441,
      "text": "and luxuries they used to rejoice therein.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 27,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4442,
      "text": "So it was; and We made another people inherit all that.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 28,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4443,
      "text": "Neither the heaven nor earth wept for them, nor were they given any respite.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 29,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4444,
      "text": "Thus did We save the Children of Israel from the humiliating punishment,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 30,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4445,
      "text": "from Pharaoh. He was indeed arrogant who transgressed all bounds.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 31,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4446,
      "text": "We chose them[8] knowingly over all other peoples.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 32,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4447,
      "text": "And We gave them signs in which there was a clear test.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 33,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4448,
      "text": "Indeed, these [Makkans] say,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 34,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4449,
      "text": "“There is nothing after our first death, and we will not be resurrected,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 35,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4450,
      "text": "then bring back our forefathers if you are truthful.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 36,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4451,
      "text": "Are they better [in power] or the people of Tubba‘[9] and those who were before them? We destroyed them, for they were truly wicked[10].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 37,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4452,
      "text": "We have not created the heavens and earth and all that is between them for amusement.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 38,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4453,
      "text": "We have not created them except for a true purpose, but most of them do not know.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 39,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 497,
      "ruku": 432,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    }
  ],
